# Local planning input; the versioned requirements manifest keeps the contract.
/AI_Game_Engine_Agent_Roadmap.txt

# Generated builds, fetched dependencies, reports and distribution staging.
# Includes minimal Ubuntu inputs in .tools/headless and server packages/evidence in out/.
# Graphics/DXC/validation source caches stay in .tools/graphics; generated SPIR-V,
# binary readbacks, validation layers and reports use build/ and out/graphics*/.
# Standalone graphics probe packages and relocation receipts also belong in out/ or dist/.
# Device/presentation JSONL traces, local verification helpers and receipts stay in out/.
# Stress/resource traces and Runtime relocation packages also stay in out/ or dist/.
# Offline shader generations, dependency manifests and build receipts stay in out/.
# GPU resource readbacks and offscreen qualification traces also stay in out/.
# Window cube captures and packaged .sharkshader bundles stay in build/, out/ or dist/.
# Keep shaders/ source recipes and HLSL fixtures eligible for versioning.
# Keep generated agent/session reports under out/; public schemas/examples stay tracked.
# EnTT/GLM caches and scene/schema/query qualification reports stay under out/ or build/.
# TLS source caches, generated local identities and network receipts stay under out/ or build/.
# Explicitly public test-only certificates in tests/fixtures/network remain versioned.
# Session enrollment experiments, local credentials and process receipts stay under out/.
# Replication traces, raw payload diagnostics and local multi-process receipts use out/ or build/.
# Interest budgets, shaped relay barriers and per-connection traces use out/ or build/.
/build/
/out/
/dist/
/_deps/
/.cache/
/.tools/
/CMakeUserPresets.json
/compile_commands.json
/CMakeCache.txt
/CMakeFiles/
/Testing/

